<Profile title="About — Dave Bettner" page="about"><section class="page-intro wrap"><h1>An accountant who<br/>works with technology.</h1><p class="lead">I’m Dave Bettner, based in Des Moines, Iowa. I work with finance teams, consultants, and technical teams to make reporting systems usable.</p></section><section class="paper"><div class="section wrap prose-grid"><figure class="about-portrait"><img src="/images/dave-bettner-headshot-20260816-cutout.png" alt="Dave Bettner" width="1312" height="1199" loading="lazy"/></figure><div class="prose"><section><h2>From reporting to implementation.</h2><p>I started at Workiva in 2015, supporting public-company SEC reporting and XBRL. That work meant managing review cycles and helping customers meet filing deadlines.</p><p>Later roles took me into healthcare integrations, Workiva solution architecture, and accounting-firm delivery leadership. Today, I’m a Senior Manager at LSL, leading Workiva delivery for city and county finance teams.</p></section><section><h2>Building as part of the job.</h2><p>I develop Python tools for reporting links, formulas, and validation checks. I’m also exploring AI-assisted accounting workflows through personal projects that make their inputs, approval requirements, and failure cases inspectable.</p><p>The part I keep coming back to is helping people understand a system well enough to use it—and finding what needs to change when they can’t.</p></section><div class="case-links"><a href="/experience/">Career history</a><a href="mailto:dbett4@gmail.com">Email me</a></div></div></div></section></Profile>
